    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/2",
    "published": "2026-11-05T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"I told you guys to slow down and take it easy or something like this would happen.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/95b43b9258c311ea8bf6005056a9",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/1",
    "published": "2026-11-05T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Just look at this room body segments everywhere!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/05/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/9c3707d0c1520137c0b4005056a9545d",
