    "published": "2026-11-04T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Two, four, six, eight, who do we appreciate \""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/c32136e0d7400137c8a6005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/2",
    "published": "2026-11-04T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Trim the bowl, you idiots! Trim the bowl!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/6f2b92d0e3ad0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/1",
    "published": "2026-11-04T12:01:00.000Z",
