  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/aecccee0e4860137cda5005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/04/0",
    "published": "2026-11-04T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"We understand your concern, ma'am but this just isn't enough for us to go on. Now, you find the other half of your husband, and then we've got a case.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/80255140cdd20137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/4",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"I told you to watch for bones.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/e4936750cdd40137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/3",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Well, well. The great hunter returneth.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/1ed7f700df110137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/2",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Just a word of warning, Myron if you miss, I'm comin' after your big hazel.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/5e4868c0e92f0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/03/1",
    "published": "2026-11-03T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Now, moving on from the so-called funny bone, we come to this little guy and you tickle him at your own peril.\""
  },
  {
