    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/28/1",
    "published": "2026-10-28T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "Professor Ferrington and his controversial theory that dinosaurs were actually the discarded \"chicken\" bones of giant, alien picnickers."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/28/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/3c497910ea260137cfba005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/28/0",
    "published": "2026-10-28T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"It's the only way to go, Frank. Why, my life's changed, ever since I discovered Stackable Livestock®.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/25/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/21385eb0e4860137cda5005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/25/1",
    "published": "2026-10-25T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "Infamous moments in jazz"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/25/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/d60d6600d7410137c8a6005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/25/0",
    "published": "2026-10-25T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"So then Sheila says to Betty that Arnold told her what Harry was up to, but Betty told me she already heard it from Blanche, don't you know \""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/17/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/81c5c860d8ba0137c959005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/17/1",
    "published": "2026-10-17T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"My word, Frank sounds like you're coming down with one heck of a cold.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/17/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/4b0a7ce0d7420137c8a6005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/17/0",
    "published": "2026-10-17T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"I see your little, petrified skull labeled and resting on a shelf somewhere.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/16/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/dde395b0cdd20137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/16/4",
    "published": "2026-10-16T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"And remember ask not what your anthill can do for you, but what you can do for your anthill.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/16/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/c111d1a0e9ef0137cf93005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/16/3",
    "published": "2026-10-16T12:03:00.000Z",
