    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/07/1",
    "published": "2026-10-07T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Consider yourself fortunate, Belsky. As curses go, that sure beats having your descendants strangled in the night by a walking corpse.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/07/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/b68760d0e6f90137ce50005056a9545d",
