    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/06/3",
    "published": "2026-10-06T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Now calm down there, ma'am your cat's gonna be fine just fine.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/06/2",
