    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/06/2",
    "published": "2026-10-06T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "Tomorrow, they would be mortal enemies. But on the eve of the great hunt, feelings were put aside for the traditional Mammoth Dance."
  },
