    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/06/0",
    "published": "2026-10-06T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Flawed cultural treasures"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/04/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/822595f0cdd30137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/04/1",
    "published": "2026-10-04T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"You moron! ... I told you it was only a mirage!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/04/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/2304d4e074330137a50b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/04/0",
    "published": "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Darrell suspected someone had once again slipped him a trick spoon with the concave side reversed."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/03/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/2bc29890cdd40137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/03/1",
    "published": "2026-10-03T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"My stomach? Your stomach's rumbling!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/10/03/0",
