    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/3",
    "published": "2026-09-28T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "Professor Wainwright's painstaking field research to decode the language of bears comes to a sudden and horrific end."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/19333460cdd40137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/2",
    "published": "2026-09-28T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Oh, Mrs. Oswald ... you've forgotten something again.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/84b2ecd0cdd20137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/1",
    "published": "2026-09-28T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"He bit the Godfather.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/081d899002810138d7bb005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/28/0",
    "published": "2026-09-28T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"C'mon, c'mon it's either one or the other.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/27/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/b7375ab0fa850137d52f005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/27/1",
    "published": "2026-09-27T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "God at His computer"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/27/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/b08d10e0dcc90137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/27/0",
    "published": "2026-09-27T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"You're a hard man, Bud.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/26/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/fd343940dcca0137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/26/1",
    "published": "2026-09-26T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Are you serious? Look at our arms! If anything, I'm twice as tan as you are.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/26/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/3d255480cdd40137c56b005056a9545d",
