    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/4",
    "published": "2026-09-25T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "The Etch A Sketch division at work"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/dbcaf220e3ae0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/3",
    "published": "2026-09-25T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "Rocking the anthropological world, a second \"Lucy\" is discovered in southern Uganda."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/925b7e00d8bb0137c959005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/2",
    "published": "2026-09-25T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Bedtime, Leroy. Here comes your animal blanket.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/cb76ff90e92d0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/1",
    "published": "2026-09-25T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "Centaur rodeos"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/665077b0d8bb0137c959005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/25/0",
    "published": "2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "The mysterious intuition of some animals"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/bd805b70d0c40137c631005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/4",
    "published": "2026-09-24T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"The fuel light's on, Frank! We're all going to die! Wait, wait. Oh, my mistake that's the intercom light.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/a15098f0e3ad0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/3",
    "published": "2026-09-24T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"You ever do this? Just sit in a place like this and antwatch?\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/b25f3540e9ef0137cf93005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/2",
    "published": "2026-09-24T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Listen up, my Cossack brethren! We'll ride into the valley like the wind, the thunder of our horses and the lightning of our steel striking fear in the hearts of our enemies! And remember stay out of Mrs. Caldwell's garden!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/7142bef0dcc90137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/24/1",
    "published": "2026-09-24T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"And don't give me that ‘I'm only bird-watching' line.\""
  }
]
